  "method_summary": [
    "Extended Fig. 10B uses clean editing metrics summarized from KRAS HDR and Trp53 indel analyses, with KP_811 Trp53 retained as missing after QC.",
    "Extended Fig. 10D uses tumor-only KRAS cut-site +/-20 bp per-pair classification outputs with HDR-positive pairs excluded from displayed non-HDR denominators and sub:83:T>C background reassignment documented in run-info JSON files.",
    "Extended Fig. 10E/F uses the corrected non-HDR G12/G13 package: strict HDR-barcode positive reads are removed before calculating tumor-only allele-read percentages."
  ],
